## 5. For the later tasks of the track (the authoring runners: nr-office-author-*; the office tool's author action)
The crate exports `brief::{parse_authoring_brief, html_brief_script, is_showcase_brief, planned_carrier_gaps,
review_brief_promises, plan_gate, review_source_grounding, review_fact_coverage, facts_gate, FACTS_SAMPLE_DISCLOSURE}`.
Briefs, deck snapshots and answers are `serde_json::Value`s with Node's key order. `html_brief_script` is
`htmlBriefScript` of pptx-html-runner.mjs (a brief HTML comment read as a script header): the HTML runner task calls it
and does not port it again. The callers still to be ported are pptx-receipt.mjs, design-review.mjs, document-brief.mjs,
design-deck-diversity.mjs and pptx-deck-rubric.mjs (all import from pptx-brief.mjs).
